{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17219240","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17219240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721924001:1":{"text":"My lady, they're here.","source_cn":"小姐，人我带到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A1C1D432DCD96B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721924002:1":{"text":"Thank you. Now then, you two wished to see Lady Silvie, I'm told?","source_cn":"辛苦你了。两位，听说你们有事想求见茜茜夫人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE408896768DD0083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721924003:1":{"text":"Y-Yes, that's right! Wait... are you Lady Silvie?","source_cn":"正、正是！您、您就是茜茜夫人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911628FB92A80F32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721924004:1":{"text":"No, you misunderstand. My name is Claria. Lady Silvie is my honored guest. She's been staying here at my place for the time being.","source_cn":"两位误会了。我叫克萝伊，茜茜夫人是我的座上宾，目前正暂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4679CC661A3A911C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721924005:1":{"text":"As for my relationship to her... you might say I serve as her guardian, in a sense.","source_cn":"我和茜茜夫人的关系……我算是她某种意义上的监护人吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB13FC709E1D22473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721924006:1":{"text":"Lady Silvie does not receive just anyone. Before I bring you to her... I need to know whether the gift you brought is something she'd consider worth her time.","source_cn":"茜茜夫人的时间非常宝贵。在正式引荐之前，我必须先确认一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6813D9D2E9F9C33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721924007:1":{"text":"W-We made it ourselves... and we put a great deal of care into it... I really hope she likes it.","source_cn":"这、这是我们精心制作的……希望夫人能喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22564F50F5D1B8A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::2":{"text":"Feather Toy","source_cn":"逗猫棒","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B767A32C1AEC70F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721924008:1":{"text":"Mm... Good materials. Nicely put together. And this feather... excellent texture. Soft, responsive, just enough spring to it.","source_cn":"嗯……选材考究，制作精良，尤其是这根羽毛，柔软，灵活，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x021D570511027E31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721924009:1":{"text":"Yes. This should do nicely.","source_cn":"我想，夫人一定会满意的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x035A1365972F67D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721924010:1":{"text":"Lady Silvie, your visitors have arrived.","source_cn":"茜茜夫人，客人到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA581EADA7885712B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:举止得体的侍女":{"text":"Polite Maid","source":"举止得体的侍女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:克萝伊":{"text":"Claria","source":"克萝伊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿德里安":{"text":"Aiden","source":"阿德里安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":3}}